# Build output: the Javy-compiled wasm. Regenerated by `npm run build` in this
# workspace (also covered by the repo root .gitignore's /extensions/*/dist).
dist

# NOTE: `generated/` is deliberately NOT ignored here, unlike the CLI scaffold's
# default. The root tsconfig includes `**/*.ts`, so `npm run typecheck` and the
# root vitest suite both resolve `../generated/api` from this workspace — and
# regenerating it requires `shopify app function typegen`, which needs the
# Shopify CLI plus a Partner session. That is not an offline-reproducible gate
# the way `npm run graphql-codegen` is for /app/types, so the typegen output is
# committed to keep a fresh clone green without network or auth.
